Implement role-based access control.

Possible employee roles:

- Junior Assistant.
- Assistant.
- Senior Assistant.
- Clerk.
- e-Sevai Operator.
- Document Verification Officer.
- Application Processing Officer.
- Department Staff.
- Authorized Reviewer.

Permissions must be configurable by the Super Admin and mapped to official organizational authority.

Examples:

| Permission | Employee | Authorized Reviewer |
|---|---|---|
| View Assigned Applications | Yes | Yes |
| Verify Documents | If authorized | Yes |
| Request Additional Documents | If authorized | Yes |
| Add Internal Notes | Yes | Yes |
| Recommend Approval | If authorized | Yes |
| Final Approval | Only if specifically authorized | Based on delegation |
| Reject Application | Only if specifically authorized | Based on delegation |
| Reassign Tasks | If authorized | Yes |
| View Department Analytics | Restricted | Based on role |

Security requirements:

- Secure authentication.
- RBAC and department-level access control.
- Employee-level application assignment.
- Citizen data isolation.
- Secure password storage.
- Session management.
