- SQL injection protection.
- Secure upload validation.
- Malware scanning where available.
- Encryption at rest and in transit.
- Sensitive-data masking.
- Audit logging.
- Rate limiting.
- Access revocation.
- Secure logout.

Employees must only see records within their assigned department, office and permissions.

Never allow frontend-only authorization. Enforce all permissions on the backend.

